The priors are \code{phi ~ Beta(a_phi, b_phi)} and
\code{lambda ~ Beta(a_lambda, b_lambda)}. The paper's likelihood is
\verb{[y | z] = prod_\{t < z\} lambda^y[t] (1 - lambda)^(1 - y[t])}, and
